  "details": "When looking at the expressions in the \"Expressions\" quick menu we see 8 named expression, like sadness, backflip... However if the avatar has custom expressions, like \"frontflip\" for example, in the \"expression\" quick menu the name of the action could not correspond to the real action, like if I press \"backflip\" the avatar does a frontflip, cause it has a custom animation that replaces the backflip animation. When we go to the \"Action\" menu instead of the \"Expression\" quick menu we can see the differences.",
